# Registry block media (images & video)

Use this when a block needs bundled raster images (PNG, JPG, WebP) or video (MP4, WebM). Most blocks (navbars, SVG-only sections, etc.) do not need this.

## Where assets live

**Images**

```
public/images/blocks/<block-id>/
  hero-section-v8-bg.png
  avatar_1.png
```

**Video**

```
public/videos/blocks/<block-id>/
  screen-demo.mp4
```
